tryx-panorama-manager (2.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Replace the Qt Widgets frontend with one Qt Quick desktop GUI and a
    separately packaged private runtime.
  * Add native Linux tray integration through StatusNotifierItem, DBusMenu,
    and freedesktop Notifications.
  * Preserve legacy serial/ADB control while adding the PASE media editor,
    export, Save as new, Replace, and verified deletion workflows.
  * Add local firmware validation and the Quick firmware panel with an
    exclusive device-transport safety gate. Physical flashing is not claimed
    as verified by this release preparation.
  * Keep the QML interface compatible with Qt 6.4.
  * Use project-owned clean-room protocol schemas and ship no bundled vendor
    media.

